        "heading": "INSIDE CUPROFUSE™",
        "text": "<p>A considered combination of peptides, scalp-care actives, botanical extracts and conditioning ingredients.<br/><br/>Powered by GHK-Cu (Copper Tripeptide-1), Cuprofuse™ brings together carefully selected ingredients to support scalp condition and the appearance of fuller, healthier-looking hair.</p>",
        "button_label": "EXPLORE THE FORMULA ↓",
        "button_link": "#formula",
        "image_alt": "Blue serum poured into a glass bottle"
      }
